  "decision": "Two alternatives, as KerML 8.2.3.4.3 states them: an annotating element, or a non-feature element. Together with FeatureElement in the same clause, this is what partitions everything that can be a member of a namespace \u2014 the clause states all three productions side by side and MemberElement is the half that is not a feature.",
